#: ../../../trace/events-landlock.rst:11
msgid ""
"Landlock emits trace events for sandbox lifecycle operations and access "
"denials.  These events can be consumed by ftrace (for human-readable trace "
"output and filtering) and by eBPF programs (for programmatic introspection "
"via BTF)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock.rst:16
